# Title: Service Installation in Suspicious Folder
# ID: 5e993621-67d4-488a-b9ae-b420d08b96cb
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: pH-T (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-03-18
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, car.2013-09-005, attack.t1543.003
# Description: Detects service installation in suspicious folder appdata
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Provider_Name == "Service Control Manager" AND EventID == "7045" AND (ImagePath CONTAINS "\\AppData\\" OR ImagePath CONTAINS "\\\\\\\\127.0.0.1" OR ImagePath CONTAINS "\\\\\\\\localhost")) AND NOT ((ServiceName == "Zoom Sharing Service" AND ImagePath CONTAINS ":\\Program Files\\Common Files\\Zoom\\Support\\CptService.exe")))
